{#- The county switcher: a <select> of the counties and a Go button. Current pages only (a dated page
    keeps its "Current profile" link: another county may have no snapshot of that date). Expects
    `county` and `switcherTopic` (the topic slug on a deck, "" on the chooser). The form is `hidden`
    until js/county-switcher.js runs, so without JavaScript only the "All county profiles" link remains.
    The county-to-topics availability map is built here at build time and embedded, so nothing is
    fetched. Changing the selection does nothing by itself; Enter or Go commits it. -#}
{%- set switcherId = "cp-switch-" + ("topic" if switcherTopic else "county") %}
<form class="cp-switcher" data-cp-switcher data-topic="{{ switcherTopic }}" data-base="{{ '/county-profiles/county/' | url }}" hidden>
<label for="{{ switcherId }}">County</label>
<select id="{{ switcherId }}">
{%- for c in countyProfiles.switcher %}
<option value="{{ c.slug }}"{% if c.slug == county.slug %} selected{% endif %}>{{ c.name }}</option>
{%- endfor %}
</select>
<button class="cpd-btn" type="submit">Go</button>
</form>
<script type="application/json" id="cp-switch-data">{{ countyProfiles.switcher | jsonify | safe }}</script>
